Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OpenFAST (Apache License, Version 2.0)
  https://github.com/OpenFAST/openfast

  VANE reads the linearization files and input decks of OpenFAST and runs the
  OpenFAST executable as a separate program. No OpenFAST source code is
  included in VANE. The multi-blade coordinate transform and the input-file
  conventions are independent implementations from the published equations
  and the OpenFAST documentation.

